OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F316A1783673336
OL,3,CTrump praises Fifa after US striker's
OL,4,Cred card wiped ahead of Belgium clash
OL,6,FDonald Trump has hailed a decision by
OL,7,FFifa's disciplinary committee to allow
OL,8,FUnited States striker Folarin Balogun
OL,9,Fto participate in the World Cup co-
OL,10,Fhosts' last-16 clash against Belgium.
OL,12,FThe Monaco forward, who has scored
OL,13,Fthree goals at the tournament, was
OL,14,Fdismissed for his challenge on Tarik
OL,15,FMuharemovic during the second half of
OL,16,Ftheir 2-0 win over Bosnia and
OL,17,FHerzegovina, but his single-match ban
OL,18,Fhas now been suspended for a
OL,19,Fprobationary period of one year.
