OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F316A1783673336
OL,3,CTrump praises Fifa after US striker's
OL,4,Cred card wiped ahead of Belgium clash
OL,6,FAccording to Fifa's disciplinary code,
OL,7,Fshould the 25-year-old commit "another
OL,8,Finfringement of a similar nature and
OL,9,Fgravity during the probationary
OL,10,Fperiod, the suspension shall be
OL,11,Frevoked and the sanction enforced
OL,12,Fwithout prejudice to any additional
OL,13,Fsanction imposed for the new
OL,14,Finfringement".
OL,16,FWriting on his Truth Social account,
OL,17,FPresident Trump said: "Thank you to
OL,18,FFIFA for doing what was right, and
OL,19,Freversing a great injustice!"
